      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Skip to main content We are expanding our partnership with the General Services Administration (GSA) through a new agreement that gives government partners a 40% discount on Claude Enterprise, Claude for Government, and the Claude API.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Approximately 500 US federal, state, and local government organizations now use Claude.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Weekly Claude for Government active users are up about eightfold since February, and usage across federal civilian agencies has grown about 20-fold in a year.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The discounts offered through the agreement are estimated to save the government $1 billion.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Utah gave Claude Code to 34 developers across 10 state agencies.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A US state CIO confirmed their team was able to respond to a ransomware attack in 8 minutes vs. the usual 2-3 days thanks to Claude.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A US state IT director used Claude Code to document 12 legacy code repositories, mapping 467 database tables and flagging 27 risks along the way.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude for Government, which delivers Claude's coding and agentic work capabilities and provides near-feature parity with commercial offerings at a FedRAMP High authorization level, was made generally available on September 30.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On Bedrock, Claude is authorized for FedRAMP High, with select models authorized for DoD IL4 and IL5 workloads in AWS GovCloud.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Enterprise is in process for FedRAMP Moderate authorization through the FedRAMP 20x program, marking the next evolution of how we are bringing the same innovative technology available commercially to the government.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/expanding-partnership-gsa",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:12.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
